<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">19082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Washington has traded bombs for strangulation in its campaign against Iran, according to a CNN report carried by Russian state media and Indian outlets.</s> <s>The target moves from Iran's military to Iranian households — insulin, imported food, the collapsing rial — and a strategy of economic suffocation produces no casualty count, no images, and therefore almost no accountability.</s> <s>Tehran hasn't said how it'll answer a siege it can't shoot at.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Survivors in Rakhine State have described Myanmar soldiers torturing and shooting seventy men in the village of Byain Phyu, testimony gathered by The Diplomat two years after the killings.</s> <s>The soldiers told them plainly it was revenge for the army's defeat by the Arakan Army at Kyauktaw — collective punishment is what a losing force does when it can no longer reach the fighters who beat it.</s> <s>No independent body has yet documented the site, which means the account rests entirely on the people who survived it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Karachi, eighteen-year-old Fatima Zehra was shot dead hours after a court in Thatta affirmed that her marriage was her own free choice.</s> <s>Police drove the couple only as far as a jurisdiction boundary rather than escorting them home as the court had ordered, so the state's protection was documentary — a paper record that also told her family exactly where she'd been.</s> <s>One suspect is in custody, and Sindh records hundreds of such killings a year with almost no convictions to show for them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombia has become the nineteenth member of the American-led counter-cartel coalition, five months after its founding and still without an approved operational plan.</s> <s>InSight Crime argues that's the point — lethal strikes on Caribbean and Pacific boats have killed more than two hundred people, and each new member spreads the accountability for those deaths a little thinner across nineteen governments.</s> <s>Nobody has shown the cocaine flow has slowed by a single kilogram.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States has sanctioned two officials of the <sub alias="International Criminal Court">ICC</sub>, barring them from American banking and travel.</s> <s>Secretary of State Marco Rubio named the pair leading the court's Palestine investigation, and because the court has no police force of its own, the durable way to break it isn't legal argument but making it impossible for its officers to bank, travel, or hire.</s> <s>Three judges were already under designation, and no member state has yet said what cooperation it'll withdraw.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Sudan's Blue Nile state, the army has withdrawn from two towns as the Rapid Support Forces opened an entirely new front with troops and drones staged across the south-eastern border.</s> <s>Radio Dabanga reports the move gives the paramilitary fresh supply corridors into a border region that had, until now, been spared the worst of the war.</s> <s>Every new front in Sudan has produced a displacement wave before it produced a battle.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Seven hundred thousand children in Gaza have no in-person schooling, and ninety-eight percent of school buildings are damaged or destroyed.</s> <s>Teachers are running classes in tents like the Al-Karama School, but destroying a school system isn't the same as destroying schools — it ends certification, records, and the examination chain that lets a child prove what grade they've reached.</s> <s><sub alias="UNICEF">UNICEF</sub> warns the literacy and numeracy losses will follow this generation for decades, long after any reconstruction.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine hasn't held an election since two thousand nineteen, and ousted minister Mykhailo Fedorov is now demanding a legal mechanism for wartime voting.</s> <s>Martial law imposed after Russia's twenty twenty-two invasion bars elections outright, so granting the demand would mean Zelenskyy suspending the very legal basis on which his own term continues.</s> <s>Parliament votes on it this week.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United Arab Emirates has suspended all trade and financial transactions with Iran until further notice, hours after two Iranian ballistic missiles were fired toward the country and one landed in its waters.</s> <s>Dubai has been Iran's single most important channel to the international banking system under sanctions — Iranian firms hold accounts there, goods clear through Jebel Ali, and families receive remittances through Emirati exchange houses.</s> <s>Closing it is the heaviest blow the Gulf has dealt Tehran in this war, and it'll be felt first by households buying imported medicine.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Sudan, a diabetic woman in Wad Madani lost not her insulin but the route it travelled on.</s> <s>Almost all aid and commercial goods must now pass through Port Sudan, the country's only functioning gateway, and because both sides collect fees at every checkpoint, the blockade isn't a policy anyone announced — it's a revenue system nobody wants dismantled.</s> <s>She's now on far worse care, and the chronically ill who die this way are never counted among the war dead.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Korea's Hanwha has beaten four American rivals to supply the <sub alias="U.S.">US</sub> Army with a wheeled one-fifty-five millimetre howitzer.</s> <s>Seoul kept its artillery lines running for decades through the years when Washington and Europe scrapped theirs as obsolete, and Ukraine and Gaza then consumed shells faster than Western industry could make them.</s> <s>Six prototypes go to testing — the country that armed the world for eighty years now buys its guns from a former aid recipient.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Andrew Cuomo told an audience at Jackson Hole that America is falling behind on crypto regulation and Congress must pass the Clarity Act.</s> <s>Cuomo heads a joint venture between the exchange <sub alias="O K X">OKX</sub> and Intercontinental Exchange, the company that owns the New York Stock Exchange — firms the bill would license.</s> <s>Read every falling-behind argument by asking who pays the person making it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Gqeberha, South Africa, fire engines couldn't refuel for at least a full day — the metro's third fuel-supply failure since May.</s> <s>Officials filed for contract renewal thirty days before expiry, far too late for the mandatory tender period, which is how procurement paperwork becomes an emergency-response failure.</s> <s>A six-month stopgap contract now runs to February.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Kyrgyzstan has ordered nineteen more companies to liquidate, while state banks cut off a hundred and forty firms — and no Western sanction was ever actually issued against them.</s> <s>Losing access to dollar clearing can kill a bank in a day, so lenders in small economies now pre-empt sanctions before any regulator acts.</s> <s>Bishkek hasn't said which firms or sectors were hit.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Lake Mead has fallen to three hundred and seventeen metres, and Lake Powell hit its own record low within days — the two largest reservoirs in the United States, supplying forty million people across seven states.</s> <s>The nineteen twenty-two Compact divided the Colorado River using flow measurements taken during the wettest stretch in centuries, so the river was over-allocated on paper from day one and every year since has drawn the difference out of storage.</s> <s>A buffer that only ever empties has a date, and the basin states face a deadline for new operating rules.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Syria has disclosed a nuclear site it concealed for eighteen years, letting inspectors sample stored uranium metal and graphite tied to the reactor Israel bombed in two thousand seven.</s> <s>Disclosure rather than discovery is the point — a new government that volunteers what it's hiding buys sanctions relief and legitimacy that no denial could purchase.</s> <s>The International Atomic Energy Agency now has to decide what the samples mean.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A model projects that a forty percent cut to the <sub alias="U.S.">US</sub> National Institutes of Health would drop the number of principal investigators by half within nine years.</s> <s>Biomedical capacity is people, not money, and the path from graduate student to independent scientist runs about fifteen years — so the trainees cut today appear as missing laboratories in the twenty forties.</s> <s>Novel drug approvals could fall forty-four percent below baseline by twenty fifty, and those are drugs that never reach Lagos, Karachi, or Jakarta either, God willing that the projection proves wrong.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two strains of purple bacteria have raised Jasmine rice yields in Thai trials, according to an early-access manuscript in Nature.</s> <s>The strains fix nitrogen and produce a growth hormone, substituting biology for imported urea — fertiliser whose price rides on global gas markets that no Thai smallholder can hedge against.</s> <s>Field results still need replication beyond the initial plots.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>From the twenty-fourth of August, YouTube will count a view the instant someone presses play, dropping the thirty-second threshold it used for long videos.</s> <s>Every channel's numbers will jump overnight, but creator pay stays tied to watch time — so the platform has split the metric that decides what you see from the metric that decides who gets paid.</s> <s>Whether historical counts get restated will determine if any creator's own back catalogue remains comparable to itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American robotics startups say Washington's ban on Chinese components has stranded them, because for many of the parts they need, no substitute exists at any price.</s> <s>Rest of World reports the policy assumed substitution was possible, but component manufacturing runs on deep capital and tacit know-how — so a ban without a domestic production line doesn't reshore anything, it just removes production.</s> <s>Founders say the factories won't be built before their runways end.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google has opened its first office in Pakistan, with a company vice president meeting Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif over AI training programmes.</s> <s>Local registration is the most effective lever any state holds over a global platform — it turns takedown and data requests from something a foreign company may ignore into something staff on the ground must answer.</s> <s>That's the trade Islamabad has made, and the same one India, Indonesia, Turkey, and Nigeria made before it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Flock cameras are now scanning licence plates inside Yosemite Valley, and rangers are objecting.</s> <s>Flock's value comes from a shared network, so each new camera enlarges one searchable national database that immigration enforcement and other agencies can already query.</s> <s>A national park has become a node in it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Stanford researchers tracking seven hundred and fifteen users found that X's algorithm rewards reply-fights over what people say they actually want to see.</s> <s>Engagement metrics can't distinguish genuine interest from anger, and the peer-reviewed study found the resulting bias skews feeds toward Democratic accounts more than Republican ones.</s> <s>The researchers say they can't explain why.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>